<title>FRANCE: Bongrain 1997 Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Bongrain 1997 Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					2.6	up 3.9 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Bongrain gave its quarterly sales results in a statement. First-quarter sales excluding tax were up 3.9 percent. On a like-for-like basis and at constant exchange rates, they rose 1.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
